*.orig
*.old
backups/*.json.gz
backups/*.sql
backups/*.dump

# 2026-09-05 hygiene: never track a virtualenv (public repo).
# docs/mcp-helper-pkg/.venv was committed before that package's own .gitignore
# existed — 2000 files, 24.56 MB, 61 of them leaking /Users/<name>/ paths in
# pip RECORD files and bin/ shebangs. .gitignore does not untrack what is
# already in the index, which is why it survived. This rule is repo-wide so the
# next venv never gets added in the first place.
.venv/
venv/
